+# Ported from HKUDS/Vibe-Trading @ 8b8e083, agent/src/factors/zoo/academic/hml.py (MIT; see THIRD_PARTY.md).
+# Changes: imports only; a per-file `ruff: noqa` header covers lint (unused imports, import order, style).
