+# Ported from HKUDS/Vibe-Trading @ 8b8e083, agent/src/factors/zoo/gtja191/alpha_006.py (MIT; see THIRD_PARTY.md).
+# Changes: imports only; a per-file `ruff: noqa` header covers lint (unused imports, import order, style).
+# ruff: noqa
+
+# ============================================================
+# 中文名称: GTJA #6 - 开盘VWAP偏离
+# 简要说明: (RANK(SIGN(DELTA((((OPEN*0.85)+(HIGH*0.15))), 4)))* -1)，开盘加权价的4日变化方向取反。
+# 典型用途: 识别开盘价的趋势变化方向，用于反趋势交易。
+# ============================================================
+"""GTJA Alpha #6.
