+Formula: ((RANK(DECAYLINEAR(DELTA(CLOSE,2),8)) - RANK(DECAYLINEAR(CORR(((VWAP*0.3)+(OPEN*0.7)),SUM(MEAN(VOLUME,180),37),14),12)))*-1)
+Source: 国泰君安 191 alpha 研报 (2017-06-15), alpha 39."""
