+Formula (verbatim from the report):
+    SMA(VOL*((CLOSE-LOW)-(HIGH-CLOSE))/(HIGH-LOW),11,2) - SMA(VOL*((CLOSE-LOW)-(HIGH-CLOSE))/(HIGH-LOW),4,2)
+
+Notes: 
+"""
+from __future__ import annotations
+
+import numpy as np
+import pandas as pd
+
+from openterm.quantlib.alpha.base import (
+    decay_linear,
+    delta,
+    rank,
