+++ b/docs/ALPHA_SKIPPED.md
@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@
+# Alpha Zoo: factors not ported
+
+Generated by `scripts/port_vibe_alphas.py` from HKUDS/Vibe-Trading @ `8b8e083`. Vibe's zoo has 478 factors; OpenTerm ports 435 and skips 43. A factor is skipped only when its inputs are data the ALPHA panel does not have (the panel is OHLCV bars of the chosen universe). Nothing is approximated silently: `vwap` and `amount` are built from the bars by `extend_panel` (see `docs/specs/PHASE_15.md`).
+
+| Reason | Count |
+|---|---|
+| needs company fundamentals / valuation ratios (fund:*, val:*); OpenTerm's ALPHA panel is OHLCV only | 20 |
+| needs a sector / industry map (`panel['sector']`) for industry neutralisation; the ALPHA panel carries no classification | 19 |
+| needs a benchmark index close series (`panel['benchmark_close']`); the ALPHA panel has stock bars only | 3 |
+| needs extra series mkt_ret, smb, hml (Fama-French style factor returns) that the panel lacks | 1 |
+
+| Factor | Family | Reason |
+|---|---|---|
+| `alpha101_048` | alpha101 | needs a sector / industry map (`panel['sector']`) for industry neutralisation; the ALPHA panel carries no classification |
+| `alpha101_056` | alpha101 | needs a sector / industry map (`panel['sector']`) for industry neutralisation; the ALPHA panel carries no classification |
